            Bonos y Servicios Extra
            <span class="absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 w-10 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full"></span>
        </h3>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full bg-[#f8fafc] border border-primary/5 py-12 px-8 md:px-12 rounded-md overflow-hidden relative group">
        <div class="relative z-10">
            <!-- Main Layout: 2/3 Cards | 1/3 Text -->
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
                
                <!-- Left: Cards (2/3) -->
                <div class="w-full lg:w-2/3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
                    <!-- BONOS COLUMN -->
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white p-5 rounded-md border border-primary/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border-l-4 border-l-accent">
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <span class="font-body font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-primary/40 leading-none mb-1">Pase Diario</span>
                                <span class="font-body font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-primary">Drop In</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-primary">10€</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white p-5 rounded-md border border-primary/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border-l-4 border-l-primary/10">
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <span class="font-body font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-primary/40 leading-none mb-1">Aventura</span>
                                <span class="font-body font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-primary">Bono 5</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-primary">40€</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white p-5 rounded-md border border-primary/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border-l-4 border-l-primary/10">
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <span class="font-body font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-primary/40 leading-none mb-1">Popular</span>
                                <span class="font-body font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-primary">Bono 10</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-primary">70€</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- MASAJES COLUMN -->
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white p-5 rounded-md border border-primary/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border-l-4 border-l-accent/40">
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <span class="font-body font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-primary/40 leading-none mb-1">Recuperación</span>
                                <span class="font-body font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-primary">Masaje 1 ses.</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-primary">42,50€</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white p-5 rounded-md border border-primary/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border-l-4 border-l-primary/10">
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <span class="font-body font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-primary/40 leading-none mb-1">Pack Relax</span>
                                <span class="font-body font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-primary">Masaje 2 ses.</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-primary">95,00€</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white p-5 rounded-md border border-primary/5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border-l-4 border-l-primary/10">
                            <div class="flex flex-col">
                                <span class="font-body font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-primary/40 leading-none mb-1">Alto Rendimiento</span>
                                <span class="font-body font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-primary">Masaje 5 ses.</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-primary">170,00€</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right: Content (1/3) -->
                <div class="w-full lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col gap-8 md:pt-4">
                    <p class="font-body text-primary/60 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed">
                        Optimiza tu rendimiento con nuestros servicios de masoterapia y planes flexibles de bonos. Diseñados para adaptarse a tu ritmo y necesidades específicas.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-accent font-body font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
                            <span class="w-8 h-px bg-accent/30"></span>
                            Excelencia · Bienestar
                        </div>
                        <a 
                            href="https://taronja.wodbuster.com/user/pagos.aspx" 
                            target="_blank" 
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="w-full sm:w-max bg-accent text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-md font-body font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-[0.15em] hover:bg-primary hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group/btn"
                        >
                            Comprar ahora
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
                            </svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .font-display { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; }
    .font-body { font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif; }
</style>
